{"product":{"id":7570307023100,"title":"POLYGON - Horror Mansion","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ciframe title=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/bbylcM2ZrMQ\" class=\"ratio-16-by-9\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSynty® Studios\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003ePresents: POLYGON - Horror Mansion\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA Spooky Low Poly asset pack of buildings, characters, props and environment assets to create a Horror themed polygonal style game. Over 650 detailed prefabs are included with this pack.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e◼ Key Features ◼\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e600+ unique assets\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10 unique characters with attachments for customisation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComplete demo scene containing a mansion built from our modular building system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully modular building system! (Compatible with POLYGON - Shops Pack and more)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLoads of decals such as rips, tears, blood pools\/splatters\/writing, cracks and more!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEverything you need to make a variety of spooky themes!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMansion demo scene includes multiple rooms plus attic, basement, and greenhouse!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- (Character poses indicative only)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e📦 Pack Content\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharacters (x10)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Butcher, Count, Demon, Ghoul, Gimp, Jock, Girl, Werewolf, Witch, Yokai.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharacter Attachments (x10)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Count Cape, Count Hair, Count Hat, Demon Tail, Jock Beard, Jock hair, Witch Antlers, Witch Hair, Hitch Hat, Witch Nose.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilding Parts (x207)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Including Walls, Doors, Windows, Floors, Roofs, Pillars, Stairs, Balconies, Bookshelves, Chimneys, Gates\/Fences, Railings, Trims, etc.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProps (x333)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Including Decals, Chairs\/Seats, Beds, Bath, Books, Junk, Cabinets, Cage, Cameras, Candles, Statuettes, Chests, Clocks, Racks, Coffins, Curtains, Desks, Ghost Hunting Gear, Chains\/Hooks, Keys, Kitchen Equipment and Appliances, Lights\/Lamps\/Chandeliers, Switches, Wall Hangings\/Paintings, Plants and Pots, Carpets, Garden Tools, Shelves, Tables, Toilet, Torches, Vents, etc.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnvironment (x91)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Including Trees and Tree Cards, Bushes, Dust, Fountains, Grass, Grounds, Hedges, Vines, Leaves, Pebbles, Twigs\/Branches, Other Plants, Roads, Spider Webs, Tiles, Well, etc\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeapons (x9)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Hacksaw, Hatchet, Ice Pick, Knives, Razor, Revolver, Screwdriver, Spanner\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFX (x14)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Including Candle Flame, Dusts, Fogs, Footprints, Leaves, Lightning, Rain, Sparks, Sun Beams, etc\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e🤖 Technical Info\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e◼ Compatibility ◼\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCompatible with Unreal 5.3+\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eCompatible with Unity 2022.3+\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e- Supports URP and Built-in\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Characters set up with Mecanim (no animations included)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/bit.ly\/synty-urp\" title=\"Converting to the Universal Render Pipeline\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eView our tutorial\u003c\/a\u003e on converting to the Universal Render Pipeline (URP).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e◼ \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eFile Formats ◼\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUnreal 5.3 project\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUnity 2022.3 package\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFBX Source Files\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e📋 Change Log\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.8.0 (Unity)\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e- Updated pack to 2022.3.56\u003cbr\u003e- Added lighting and post processing\u003cbr\u003e- Converted shaders to shader graph\u003cbr\u003e- Added generics folder\u003cbr\u003e- Naming convention cleanup\u003cbr\u003e- Fixed collision issues\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.6.0 (Unreal)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Ported pack to Unreal Engine 5.3 \u003cbr\u003e- Convert characters to the UE4 mannequin rig\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.7.6 (Unity + Source Files)\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e- Fixed issue with SM_Bld_Wall_Window_04\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"4m3qj\" data-offset-key=\"5vdqk-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-offset-key=\"5vdqk-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan data-offset-key=\"5vdqk-0-0\"\u003e\u003cspan data-text=\"true\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.7.5 (Unity)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"4m3qj\" data-offset-key=\"bg5j-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-offset-key=\"bg5j-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan data-offset-key=\"bg5j-0-0\"\u003e\u003cspan data-text=\"true\"\u003e- Fixed Demo scene model scale issue\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-offset-key=\"bg5j-0-0\" class=\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cspan data-offset-key=\"bg5j-0-0\"\u003e\u003cspan data-text=\"true\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.7.4 (Unity)\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e- Adjusted camera clipping settings in demo scene\u003cbr\u003e- Added overview map\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.7.3 (Unity)\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e- Added collision to SM_Env_Well_01\u003cbr\u003e- Fixed prefab transform issues\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.7.2 (Unity)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Created missing prefab for SM_Bld_Fence_Brick_02\u003cbr\u003e- Fixed import settings for SM_Bld_Wall_Half_Angled_01\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.5.1 (Unreal + Source Files)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Updated new skeleton to fix pelvis bone issue\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.7.1 (Unity)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Fixed collision issues with SM_Bld_Basement_Entrance_01\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.5.0 (Unreal + Source Files)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Updated FX to Niagara\u003cbr\u003e- New_Characters folder added to the project with ready to use characters.\u003cbr\u003e- New Unreal characters added to the source files\u003cbr\u003e- Various bug fixes\u003cbr\u003e- Added individual character FBX files to Source Files\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.7.0 (Unity)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Added a Unity 2022 URP Extract me with Forward+ support\u003cbr\u003e- Removed shader errors if Amplify isn't installed\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.6.0 (Unity)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Fixed missing scripts on convex collision\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.5.0 (Unity)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e- Added FX_Lightray_Round_01 prefab\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.4.0 (Unity)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Fixed rendering issues with GrungeTriplanar shader\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion 1.3.0 (Unity)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Updated URP_ExtractMe to fix URP shader issues.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Synty Store","product_type":"Polygon","created_at":"2022-02-11T15:19:19+13:00","handle":"polygon-horror-mansion","updated_at":"2026-06-12T04:40:31+12:00","published_at":"2022-02-14T09:55:15+13:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"FBX, full-price, Horror, Polygon, Unity, Unreal","variants":[{"id":42564997447932,"product_id":7570307023100,"title":"Default Title","price":"99.99","sku":"polygon-horror-mansion-pack","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":null,"option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2022-02-11T15:19:20+13:00","updated_at":"2026-06-12T04:40:31+12:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"","grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":false,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]}],"options":[{"id":9646337917180,"product_id":7570307023100,"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}],"images":[{"id":39337197207804,"product_id":7570307023100,"position":1,"created_at":"2023-05-31T16:43:00+12:00","updated_at":"2025-10-02T18:09:06+13:00","alt":"POLYGON Horror Mansion asset pack for Unity and Unreal Engine game development","width":1024,"height":1024,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1